<section class="auth-heading"><div class="auth-kicker"><span class="pulse-dot"></span> Local development access</div><h1>Welcome back.</h1><p>Sign in to inspect projects, run workflows, and follow every event in the testing console.</p></section>
<section class="auth-grid"><div class="panel auth-card"><div class="panel-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">Existing operator</p><h2>Sign in</h2></div><span class="step-badge">01</span></div><form class="auth-form" data-auth-action="/auth/sign-in"><label for="sign-in-email">Email address</label><input id="sign-in-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@local.dev" required><label for="sign-in-password">Password</label><input id="sign-in-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="••••••••" required><button class="button button-primary button-wide" type="submit">Enter console <span>→</span></button></form><p class="auth-result" data-auth-result></p></div><div class="panel auth-card auth-card-secondary"><div class="panel-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">First time here?</p><h2>Create account</h2></div><span class="step-badge">02</span></div><form class="auth-form" data-auth-action="/auth/sign-up"><label for="sign-up-name">Name</label><input id="sign-up-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" required><label for="sign-up-email">Email address</label><input id="sign-up-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@local.dev" required><label for="sign-up-password">Password</label><input id="sign-up-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Create a password" required><button class="button button-wide" type="submit">Create local account <span>→</span></button></form><p class="auth-result" data-auth-result></p></div></section>
<p class="auth-footer"><span class="status-dot status-dot-active"></span> Runs locally · No production data</p>
